## Why This Is Asked
Tests ability to design a cost-aware, privacy-preserving on-device ML feature with hardware constraints and OTA workflows.

## Key Concepts
- On-device graph neural networks
- Privacy-preserving data handling
- OTA delta updates
- Drift detection and validation
